  "goodToKnow": "Das Horoskop is a horoscope: das Tageshoroskop in newspapers, sich ein Horoskop erstellen lassen. Its Greek name means observing the hour, the time of birth used by astrologers. Many Germans read horoscopes for fun, though astrology has no scientific basis. Was bist du für ein Sternzeichen? is a common small-talk question. Plural: die Horoskope."
